flowchart TD
    A[Student reports an item as LOST or FOUND] --> B[Report saved with OPEN status]
    B --> C[Users browse and search public listing]
    C --> D{Is this a FOUND report?}
    D -- No --> C
    D -- Yes --> E[Student submits private ownership evidence]
    E --> F[Backend checks owner, item status and duplicate/approved claims]
    F --> G[Claim saved as PENDING]
    G --> H[Administrator reviews private evidence]
    H --> I{Decision}
    I -- Reject --> J[Save REJECTED and reason]
    I -- Approve --> K[Save APPROVED and collection instructions]
    K --> L[Claimant physically collects item]
    L --> M[Administrator confirms collection]
    M --> N[Report status becomes RETURNED]
    N --> O[Public listing displays RETURNED; new claims blocked]
